{"unit_id":"sinvacn__dsh-file-pane#card-zh","repo":"sinvacn/dsh-file-pane","commit":"151936e2fe2277b096b464db1fba6ac7ff7a42eb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-file-pane 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的右侧栏文件面板插件。它将工作区文件树旁的文件预览安排在左侧分栏，并提供类似 VS Code 的单击预览和双击固定标签。聊天中的文件链接可定位到指定行；右键文件或目录可以复制相对或绝对路径，也能在对应目录打开终端。选中预览内容后可复制，或将带文件路径、行号和代码块的引用插入对话编辑框。适合需要并排查看工作区文件、终端和 DSH 对话的开发场景；新分栏默认文件窗格占比为 0.7，可通过本地设置调整。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:596-686","client.js:568-591","client.js:790-847","client.js:43-46"]}
{"unit_id":"sinvacn__dsh-file-pane#card-en","repo":"sinvacn/dsh-file-pane","commit":"151936e2fe2277b096b464db1fba6ac7ff7a42eb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-file-pane adds a file pane to DSH’s web sidebar. It displays previews beside the workspace tree, supports preview and pinned tabs, and opens file links at requested lines. Context menus copy paths, open a terminal, or insert selected code into the composer with its file reference.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:596-686","client.js:568-591","client.js:790-847"]}
