{"unit_id":"sinvacn__dsh-file-pane#feature-1","repo":"sinvacn/dsh-file-pane","commit":"151936e2fe2277b096b464db1fba6ac7ff7a42eb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-file-pane 的功能「文件分栏预览」：从工作区文件树打开文件时，将预览放到树旁的独立窗格；单击打开或替换预览标签，双击可固定标签。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:568-591","client.js:647-681","client.js:850-866"]}
